#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:107
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"gobject-introspection\"/> (should be "
"installed before gtk+, atk, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"<xref role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"gobject-introspection\"/> (deveria ser "
"instalado antes de gtk+, atk, etc.)"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:111
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Quoted directly from the <filename>INSTALL</filename> file: <quote>Some of "
"the mimetype-related functionality in GIO requires the <command>update-mime-"
"database</command> and <command>update-desktop-database</command> "
"utilities</quote>, which are part of <xref role=\"runtime\" "
"linkend=\"shared-mime-info\"/> and <xref role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"desktop-"
"file-utils\"/>, respectively.  These two utilities are also needed for some "
"tests."
msgstr ""
"Citado diretamente do arquivo <filename>INSTALL</filename>: <quote>Algumas "
"das funcionalidades relacionadas ao tipo mime no GIO exigem os utilitários "
"<command>update-mime-database</command> e <command>update-desktop-"
"database</command></quote>, os quais são parte de <xref role=\"runtime\" "
"linkend=\"shared-mime-info\"/> e <xref role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"desktop-"
"file-utils\"/>, respectivamente. Esses dois utilitários também são "
"necessários para alguns testes."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:124
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of GLib"
msgstr "Instalação de GLib"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:127
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If desired, apply the optional patch. In many cases, applications that use "
"this library, either directly or indirectly via other libraries such as "
"<xref linkend=\"gtk3\"/>, output numerous warnings when run from the command"
" line.  This patch enables the use of an environment variable, "
"<envar>GLIB_LOG_LEVEL</envar>, that suppresses unwanted messages. The value "
"of the variable is a digit that corresponds to:"
msgstr ""
"Se desejado, aplique o remendo opcional. Em muitos casos, os aplicativos que"
" usam essa biblioteca, direta ou indiretamente, por meio de outras "
"bibliotecas, tais como <xref linkend=\"gtk3\"/>, emitem numerosos avisos "
"quando executados a partir da linha de comando. Esse remendo habilita o uso "
"de uma variável de ambiente, <envar>GLIB_LOG_LEVEL</envar>, que suprime "
"mensagens indesejadas. O valor da variável é um dígito que corresponde a:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><simplelist><member>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:136
#, xml-text
msgid "1 Alert"
msgstr "1 Alerta"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><simplelist><member>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:137
#, xml-text
msgid "2 Critical"
msgstr "2 Crítico"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><simplelist><member>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:138
#, xml-text
msgid "3 Error"
msgstr "3 Erro"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><simplelist><member>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:139
#, xml-text
msgid "4 Warning"
msgstr "4 Aviso"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><simplelist><member>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:140
#, xml-text
msgid "5 Notice"
msgstr "5 Informe"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:144
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For instance <userinput>export GLIB_LOG_LEVEL=4</userinput> will skip output"
" of Warning and Notice messages (and Info/Debug messages if they are turned "
"on).  If <envar>GLIB_LOG_LEVEL</envar> is not defined, normal message output"
" will not be affected."
msgstr ""
"Por exemplo, <userinput>export GLIB_LOG_LEVEL=4</userinput> pulará a saída "
"gerada de mensagens Warning e Notice (e mensagens de Informação/Depuração se"
" estiverem ativadas). Se <envar>GLIB_LOG_LEVEL</envar> não estiver definida,"
" a saída gerada normal de mensagem não será afetada."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:150
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../glib-skip_warnings-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../glib-skip_warnings-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><warning><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:154
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If a previous version of glib is installed, move the headers out of the way "
"so that later packages do not encounter conflicts:"
msgstr ""
"Se uma versão anterior da glib estiver instalada, [então] mova os cabeçalhos"
" para fora do caminho, de modo que os pacotes posteriores não encontrem "
"conflitos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><warning><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:158
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">if [ -e /usr/include/glib-2.0 ]; then\n"
"    rm -rf /usr/include/glib-2.0.old &amp;&amp;\n"
"    mv -vf /usr/include/glib-2.0{,.old}\n"
"fi</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">if [ -e /usr/include/glib-2.0 ]; then\n"
"    rm -rf /usr/include/glib-2.0.old &amp;&amp;\n"
"    mv -vf /usr/include/glib-2.0{,.old}\n"
"fi</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:166
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>GLib</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>GLib</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:170
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..            \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release \\\n"
"      -Dman=true          &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..            \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release \\\n"
"      -Dman=true          &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:180
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <xref linkend=\"libxslt\"/> is installed, the above command may indicate "
"several (about 33) errors that start with \"Error: no ID for constraint "
"linkend:\" when generating the man pages.  These are harmless."
msgstr ""
"Se <xref linkend=\"libxslt\"/> estiver instalado, [então] o comando acima "
"possivelmente indique vários (cerca de 33) erros que começam com \"Error: no"
" ID for constraint linkend:\" ao gerar as páginas de manual. Esses são "
"inofensivos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:186
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>GLib</application> test suite requires "
"<application>desktop-file-utils</application> for some tests. However, "
"<application>desktop-file-utils</application> requires "
"<application>GLib</application> in order to compile; therefore, you must "
"first install <application>GLib</application> and then run the test suite."
msgstr ""
"A suíte de teste da <application>GLib</application> exige "
"<application>desktop-file-utils</application> para alguns testes. No "
"entanto, <application>desktop-file-utils</application> exige a "
"<application>GLib</application> para a finalidade de compilar; portanto, "
"você precisa primeiro instalar a <application>GLib</application> e então "
"executar a suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:195
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:198
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>ninja install &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir -p /usr/share/doc/glib-&glib2-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -r ../docs/reference/{gio,glib,gobject} /usr/share/doc/glib-&glib2-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>ninja install &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir -p /usr/share/doc/glib-&glib2-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -r ../docs/reference/{gio,glib,gobject} /usr/share/doc/glib-&glib2-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:204
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You should now install <xref linkend=\"desktop-file-utils\"/> and <xref "
"linkend=\"shared-mime-info\"/> and proceed to run the test suite."
msgstr ""
"Você deveria agora instalar <xref linkend=\"desktop-file-utils\"/> e <xref "
"linkend=\"shared-mime-info\"/> e proceder à execução da suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><warning><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:211
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Do not run the test suite as &root; or some tests will fail unexpectedly and"
" leave some non-FHS-compliant directories in the <filename "
"class='directory'>/usr</filename> hierarchy."
msgstr ""
"Não execute a suíte de teste como &root; ou alguns testes falharão "
"inesperadamente e deixarão alguns diretórios não compatíveis com FHS na "
"hierarquia <filename class='directory'>/usr</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:218
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, after having installed the package, issue: "
"<command>LC_ALL=C ninja test</command> as a non-&root; user."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, depois de ter instalado o pacote, emita: "
"<command>LC_ALL=C ninja test</command> como um(a) usuário(a) não &root;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:224
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:230
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dman=true</parameter>: This switch causes the build to create "
"and install the package man pages."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dman=true</parameter>: Essa chave faz com que a construção crie "
"e instale as páginas de manual do pacote."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:235
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dgtk_doc=true</option>: This switch causes the build to create and "
"install the API documentation."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dgtk_doc=true</option>: Essa chave faz com que a construção crie e "
"instale a documentação da API."

